1116	+ * complete-stat-routes additionally checks followed and no-follow proc-fd stat.
1117	+ * Every assertion in a selected mode is mandatory; there is no fallback mode.
1118	+ * Inherited stdio uses only fstat bookkeeping: its cross-entrypoint alias
1119	+ * behavior is a separate repair. Each mode applies unchanged on native Linux,
